{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1538156275,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNjQ5Nzk3MDY=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2883","origin":"github"},"title":"Enhance `datalad siblings` to query/configure parameters of special remotes","message":"Whenever `git annex info` exposes all the remote parameters within `info` output:\n\n```shell\n$\u003e git annex info s3-PUBLIC       \nuuid: deaa691f-c824-4416-9bf8-a94a47dd31b5\ndescription: [s3-PUBLIC]\nremote: s3-PUBLIC\ntrust: untrusted\ncost: 200.0\ntype: S3\ncreds: not available\nbucket: openneuro.org\nendpoint: s3.amazonaws.com\nport: 80\nstorage class: STANDARD\npartsize: 1.07 gigabytes\npublic: no\nversioning: no\nencryption: none\nchunking: none\nexport: yes\nremote annex keys: 136\nremote annex size: 2.42 gigabytes (+ 56 unknown size)\n```\nwe do not provide them anyhow, although they (e.g. all those `export`, `publicurl`, etc) could be very well to know:\n```shell\n$\u003e datalad -f json_pp siblings -s s3-PUBLIC\n{\n  \"action\": \"query-sibling\",\n  \"annex-description\": \"[s3-PUBLIC]\",\n  \"annex-s3\": \"true\",\n  \"annex-uuid\": \"deaa691f-c824-4416-9bf8-a94a47dd31b5\",\n  \"name\": \"s3-PUBLIC\",\n  \"path\": \"/tmp/ds000001\",\n  \"refds\": \"/tmp/ds000001\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"type\": \"sibling\"\n}\n\n$\u003e datalad -f json_pp siblings -s s3-PUBLIC configure\n{\n  \"action\": \"configure-sibling\",\n  \"annex-description\": \"[s3-PUBLIC]\",\n  \"annex-ignore\": \"false\",\n  \"annex-s3\": \"true\",\n  \"annex-uuid\": \"deaa691f-c824-4416-9bf8-a94a47dd31b5\",\n  \"fetch\": \"+refs/heads/*:refs/remotes/s3-PUBLIC/*\",\n  \"name\": \"s3-PUBLIC\",\n  \"path\": \"/tmp/ds000001\",\n  \"refds\": \"/tmp/ds000001\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"type\": \"sibling\"\n}\n\n```","files":null}]}